  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Design of a master plan for a technological Agro-Industrial Park (Agro-Industrial Technopole) to improve food processing value addition and employment in Cameroon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will develop a master plan for a technological Agro-Industrial Park (Agro-Industrial Technopole) to improve value addition and employment in Cameroon.  The master plan includes the feasibility study and the study of infrastructure, a financial plan, the management structure, a promotion strategy and incentive policies.</narrative>
  </description>
